<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence linked to Mexican cartels continues with a small plane crash that killed the pilot and co-pilot shortly after takeoff in Mexico, and an escaped California inmate sought for killing a Mexican police commander in a shootout. Immigration enforcement actions intensified as an ICE officer was indicted for running over an undocumented Mexican immigrant, while a Chinese citizen was convicted of drug trafficking tied to the Jalisco New Generation Cartel. Mexico deployed 450 troops to Matamoros in response to recent violence and faces resistance to a school cellphone ban from parents concerned about safety. A Mexican priest recovered after being kidnapped, and a highland community of Tzotzil women documented patriarchal violence in a new review. 37 battle-related deaths were recorded in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPY0RfS3JmdEtteW15RW5ndlVhQnM5SDIyWVV3NWhiYTRrNjJVWmtia2lkZ0taNlVhcW1GNjNRcDdjLTc1Q3UxS2NPRjl5WDBabkpoTEdwaFZkYklxaDJ3b1hxQmdaVnBvMFJfdEtrX25xejlxTjBlblkyU3IxcVFWb0htT0c0bVJHbnl2eHVkS29VelFaUV9LYUJ5MEV3NTZGVnh3c0ZJSmJTNFdoakwzQWQ2TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Telangana Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5Lc1hqdFRVR3dNNTM0eXY3d1h0ckRaNFktQUlJcVhKa1N5NEpFYmVJbWlGc3M3U09DcmsteVhxRjFSYWIyby03TGtrSDRjUHpzcFgtaWpZNmpjVUc2?oc=5&quot;&gt;People.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;newscentermaine.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxO